			title = "A Remote Detonation",
			hint = "Gather what the gnome needs for his explosive device.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 1077 },
			},
			text = [=[Gaxim's plan needed two things he could not make himself. The first was Nitromirglyceronium, or NG-5, which only his old colleague Lomac Gearstrip of {link:tinker-town}Tinker Town{/link} could brew. The second was a spell that would let a charge go off from afar, and for that he wrote to Collin Mauren, a mage of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. When both came into his hands, Gaxim declared his device perfect. The wagons of dynamite were ready.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "covert-operations",
			title = "Covert Operations",
			hint = "Carry out the gnome's plans against the Venture Company.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 1079 },
				{ type = "quest", id = 1080 },
			},
			text = [=[The explosions were never the point, Gaxim insisted. They were a distraction. While the goblins ran about in panic, the true prize was taken: the engineering plans from the lumber mill south of {link:cragpool-lake}Cragpool Lake{/link}, and the company's private letters. With them, Gaxim hoped to find the weaknesses of the goblin machines, and perhaps to borrow a few of their designs as well.]=],
		},
	},
	mentions = {
